    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This dataset is a supplement to Stanford PhD dissertation \"Thermodynamics of Metal Oxides for Hydrogen via Thermochemical Cycling\". It contains a library of digitized temperature—partial pressure of oxygen—oxygen content diagrams for 146 individual perovskite oxide and related chemistries. Included are about the data source, digitized raw data, interpolated isotherms, partial molar enthalpy and entropy of oxygen, and defect model reaction energies for each chemistry.",
